'''''Lampranthus stipulaceus''''' is a succulent belonging to the genus ''[[Lampranthus]]''.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Lampranthus stipulaceus (L.) N.E.Br.|url=http://redlist.sanbi.org/species.php?species=88-205|work=SANBI Redlist}}</ref> The species is endemic to the [[Western Cape]], and the population is stable.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Lampranthus stipulaceus (L.) N.E.Br.|url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:362333-1|work=Plants of the World Online}}</ref>

